#: scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b12f7740a5e6295fa4b06403c89da20fb0570bf5ff407a4e7c069f96b8b6543
#. default-sha256: 8dfd7e767745087d88b21edb8e1946b82ef45c69aeff11802bef88034716ec91
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Master... ⟪k:7⟫What are your thoughts on the tale so far? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Which of the siblings do you think was in the right, Master—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫the brother, or the sister?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫老爷……⟪k:7⟫您是怎么看待这一切的？⟪k:8⟫正确的，到底是哥哥，⟪k:9⟫"
"还是妹妹呢？"

#: scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b70bc984b783e91be395c5128b6dea2479058685ac61069661de9917a976664
#. default-sha256: 186f8490593d4f9de2bf2b03a788a85e0325d8af50f2e2359c9672eaff44c56d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my. I apologize for the abrupt question. ⟪k:1⟫Did I startle you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……实在很抱歉，⟪k:1⟫下仆突然插话进来。⟪k:2⟫打搅到您了吗？"

#: scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7511eaea63278ce240b52768b4ce87a7a76d2d65d5df3a99cd1a396c0e08aec1
#. default-sha256: 7f93a5405216458c5986cf8ad16835f9a32a79ba56815fcacc7fd5cc05ed64ee
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do I think? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, yes, I believe Mell was probably right. ⟪k:2⟫He was also surely "
"happier than her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫嗯？⟪k:1⟫您问下仆的观点？⟪k:2⟫是嘛……在下仆看来，⟪k:3⟫哥哥的话更有道理。⟪k:4⟫……可最为幸福的，"
"⟪k:5⟫也是哥哥。"

#: scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad947a2ef819e038d6eb53949baf8d304c63163e564054284f34796b6721f0b7
#. default-sha256: 2f37fa180a5001fa04dd8458e0faf1d7ea99d09377b06e640f5815d828697258
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As Mell had anticipated, Nellie fled from the theatre, leaving her fiancé behind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫意料之中，⟪k:1⟫奈莉没有回到婚约者身边，⟪k:2⟫而是从剧院中落荒而逃。"

#: scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bce2204329b997ca43044856f885a6623a8832fa9d8899febd5c30fe2f1d6ca
#. default-sha256: 7d3c1218b01d05f01211cc09e043d92f460bd0faf1c5e27a1ec450c53aa8876f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She forced her way into a carriage stopped outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probably one called for a "
"different nobleman—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and ordered it to take her home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫剧院的门口停泊着一辆马车——⟪k:1⟫大概是别的宾客招来的吧，⟪k:2⟫但奈莉已经顾不得这些，⟪k:3⟫她跳上"
"马车，⟪k:4⟫蛮横地强迫着车夫把她送回了家。"

#: scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 391710b812153bea93d579541876518e912713abe57ff724225cc4ace1cce355
#. default-sha256: 18369fc4e2408128b72b4dd98875a6fd2cef3e15c68f99b879609ad9dcb47d79
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mell’s assumption was correct: the only place she had to return to was the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是的，⟪k:1⟫正如梅尔所料的那样——⟪k:2⟫对于奈莉，家才是唯一的归处。⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 812450d9d968547f36c52e872f1ec67d193b73e5871c266c66e3e701698e4969
#. default-sha256: cac34b929af8783d64192987f2de6e799ecda170046013dcbb3c0c8f38eacee7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun was beginning to set, and as a young lady, she could not simply go wandering through "
"town alone..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫天色已经慢慢暗了下来。⟪k:1⟫对于她这样的贵族小姐，⟪k:2⟫游荡在外面的街道显然并不安全……"

#: scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e914cf3b985acb6d30fcf088eb6807dca1b2c9dfcee00b65c1407e58b095453
#. default-sha256: 84706f69300bf79ba17debfeca0cd5d2669a6aedf87d71aa2db2e7663a2d3b69
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫nor did she have any acquaintances to take her in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫更甚的是，⟪k:1⟫奈莉没有其他可以依靠的人。"

#: scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 431660c182a4e923016d4e1f312554487a8c716116683573c37fc1d5ec047f31
#. default-sha256: 357a10e9ed3c79753bdab33f00dfc361824cbf0c38b3f5fdb6992ebbc6e4f5ee
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her world was, in essence, composed of two elements: her brother and the rose garden. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They were the light of her life at Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她的世界，⟪k:1⟫由两样东西所构成——⟪k:2⟫蔷薇花园，和她的哥哥。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫只要这两样东西在，她的"
"「蔷薇之馆」就会五彩斑斓。"

#: scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ceb87aab1c859860d4b9cc4b97598d25ae78dce02af50664e5584dbb4a2c409
#. default-sha256: 07ccdcc8dc23b2fc82b75c5bc5844088788536c62fa7e67ff5630146c056f6e1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She lived a very... ⟪k:2⟫isolated existence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那是——⟪k:2⟫非常封闭的世界。"

#: scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 103903fdb1da3c81e2d78276c67e1d66e9782e9f38c754aab1c8ddac3e5f8ee6
#. default-sha256: 5c5057a5bf108530c365d96688ae4e29eadb7a9e66f2d26648bca742e6b3fd15
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫……哈啊……⟪k:15⟫哈"
"啊……"

#: scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0371743309bcc1ac9e7f0c03123eb44431ffbc43bf301102e4a9b2cb2fd956f0
#. default-sha256: 3cfae6d21de7216abc4f2d98362fef2e1a03a4f815663966a8cee2e1a641957c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh... ⟪k:4⟫nnnnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫呜、⟪k:3⟫呜呜……⟪k:4⟫呜……"

#: scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64510765a22358166950a0c1ea5d86d6325d19c10fecca38a0ec7080019d5604
#. default-sha256: 9692f52b0b205a4279745e2afcb02ad7cd6b1d80c3f8767e482b6ddbf7da32b0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When she escaped back home, Nellie went straight to her room, locked the door, and "
"began sobbing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫逃回到家中的奈莉，⟪k:2⟫一刻不停地飞奔回自己的房间。⟪k:3⟫反锁上房门后，⟪k:4⟫泪水止不住地"
"夺眶而出。"

#: scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 611b6b906cf4a63c594996c7caab6f0a8d2ac755ee361b2f413df35d5fdb73d2
#. default-sha256: 74d6dd11774485f12efcde69eb60cef9deaeb5647cc401fcb689db3039e2d9c7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The waves of her sorrow came crashing effortlessly over the levees."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她的悲伤如同湍急的洪流，⟪k:1⟫压垮了堤防。"

#: scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e93aa9d27a4db2d17109522bfcd1a92e02d97986bbd388c3884ea33a05c6e73
#. default-sha256: f2b3c3fdf9418b199cc86c8898e62e4de7be9c6082fb681de43bc98fccbbd74e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tears streamed through the cracked walls of the dams blocking her tear ducts."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫决堤的泪腺流淌出豆大的泪珠，⟪k:1⟫断了线似的滑落下来。"

#: scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0208f3ed6bae1d47876bd6838c08bd7f94087f1438e9aa275d6d40dc95e9762
#. default-sha256: 82249dce600286d7a1fea2a11f8975589569f4c60aa1bbdee8cb601707377d70
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh, ⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why... ⟪k:7⟫whyyyy?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫呜……⟪k:3⟫啊啊啊啊……⟪k:4⟫……⟪k:5⟫呜……⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫为什么……究竟是为什么……"

#: scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a19f3d444f7e91e5060d490d3f7f5082c9084e73667dc92015f947c82caacf25
#. default-sha256: c1d40779cb2c6b554017a3e6313d9b875fcde42adbb808fed9ac775ae94b8754
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why won’t you help me, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why won’t you take my side...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为什么……⟪k:1⟫哥哥大人你不帮奈莉……？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫为什么……⟪k:4⟫你不站在我这边……？"

#: scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ea301dbfe73a8de653f6c26c0df8d2954fe6f1431a1947c0f58431065e19e5a
#. default-sha256: dc02955c87dacd5b5637d45ae2538f4a06472d1816cee79617e550f6e2a0bec6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The decor in her room appeared blurry through her damp eyes. ⟪k:1⟫Memories of the day she "
"had it redecorated played back in her mind with crystal clarity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫泪水模糊了视线，⟪k:1⟫映照出房间里的点点滴滴。⟪k:2⟫鲜明的记忆浮现在脑海中，⟪k:3⟫她回想到整理房"
"间布局的那一天。"

#: scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f87f8938de68e6df39defed6cdbd5d5ee5daac8c7ed185af4e6cfb20c9845006
#. default-sha256: c6c8f6b9453ed50c4ca531863e1b4f69ef44d71c2c83415129e8961724e7cf10
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She told me... ⟪k:2⟫she had no feelings for you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你明明和奈莉说过……⟪k:2⟫对哥哥大人没有非分之想！"

#: scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21b002cfa5a2f74d0f0442f54663b402e06785e047011ae2f50d513ead158113
#. default-sha256: 0e7a5606a38f4b3a2809050c252bebca91d88b3b3690f9b00da6d19dd41f2a62
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That liar!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That liar!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫骗子！——⟪k:2⟫大骗子！⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a82c65f6c0a3db05da602212e1c9a9b82eb6537daa23f53c8f8bedd098851c0a
#. default-sha256: 0352913973d8100159634c4f9d41f8eb42a6130fc84966755967f2ec4b34f600
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She let her emotions run wild, breaking glass craftworks, silver plates designed by famous "
"foreign artisans, flower vases, all sorts of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她的愤怒爆发了。⟪k:1⟫精细的琉璃制品、⟪k:2⟫舶来品的高档银器、⟪k:3⟫漂亮的花瓶——⟪k:4⟫手边能够到"
"的任何东西，⟪k:5⟫都被奈莉摔了出去。"

#: scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1c8be0aabf2979c784c99c7b321e7f1dbaa8f228e25fa2018324511d16972e6
#. default-sha256: 7bbf956abd162b08b055e59c625f8eb6154a7032cb6039490b4c9f89b79b8217
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though a beast had been set loose in her bedchamber."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫此刻的她，⟪k:1⟫被愤怒和伤感折磨着心智。"

#: scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 535fc2c4a9f9057fa5ae0e666c2ba5d268f62a486ff73df0ccbf3a6dabd091e3
#. default-sha256: 0deac97a03f0d3435b3eb8acae50b3eaa17949406fb1e891ad3643b798ba6829
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫——呜！⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f55cfe52b8db91494835c6b8115ba28bf960fb00b158cafee7ddd058b3cfa1f0
#. default-sha256: 06dfb692d48783659e214b302384e6621e0a003b84e19b9229e8259504d195b4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The vase she tossed shattered against a painting hanging on the wall, spraying water, "
"porcelain, and roses in every direction."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫当投出的花瓶砸到墙上挂着的一幅画时，⟪k:2⟫她突然沉默了下来。"

